  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting National Reconciliation and Social Cohesion through the Establishment of Provincial Peace and Reconciliation Commissions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to support the operationalization of the provincial branches of the National Commission for Peace, National Reconciliation and Social Cohesion in each of the targeted provinces. The project will focus on two main components which are: a) the effective implementation of the recommendations of the recent Inclusive and Sovereign National Dialogue (DNIS) relating in particular to the consolidation of peace and national reconciliation through technical and material support for the establishment of provincial branches of the National Commission, and b) the establishment of a conducive environment for dialogue and cohesion between communities, but also between populations in general and in particular young girls and boys and authorities (administrative and security) through awareness-raising, training and support for local peacebuilding initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
